  "documentation": {
    "mimeType": "text/markdown",
    "content": "PSI for a feature exceeded 0.10 (threshold justified in README: above noise floor at N>=500, below injected-drift PSI). Check the dashboard drift panel, then decide: retrain, roll back, or no action. Do not retrain until you know whether the upstream data is broken."
  }
